# Full Moon Drumming

This August 29th It's Saturday, so let's Saturplay! This months Saturplay just so happens to land right on the full moon. How auspicious! Drums and the full moon are kindred spirits and have come together, with the help of people, for millennia. Food, chai, and cakes and lots of smiling faces (covered in cake) will set the groove from 2pm at [The Lane](https://www.facebook.com/thelaneatpalmwoods) in Palmwoods. Drums/live music will add significant rhythm from 4pm! What better way to celebrate the full moon than with all that goodness!  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dZBA5zN9xDo There will be some more info updated as we get closer to the day, so to stay updated on prizes, guest performers see [here](https://www.facebook.com/events/1443102672657968/).
